    {"id":"file:packages/harness/src/shell-audit.ts","type":"file","name":"shell-audit.ts","filePath":"packages/harness/src/shell-audit.ts","summary":"Shell 命令审计日志模块，将执行的 shell 命令写入 JSONL 审计日志文件，支持按日期轮转和异步缓冲写入。","tags":["audit","logging","shell","security"],"complexity":"complex"},
